{
  "id": "real-function-accuracy",
  "goals": [
    "LeanExe.ProofKit.F64SignedRounding.WithinSteps 1 (Real.sin (value x.toBits)) (f x).toBits",
    "c.toNat ≤ (LeanExe.ProofKit.F64PositiveRounding.roundNearestEven y).toNat + 1",
    "|value w - Real.exp x| ≤ e for the word of a library function",
    "Runs false env compiled.module k store [.f64 x.toBits] fun final values => ∃ w, values = [.f64 w] ∧ (Finite x.toBits → WithinSteps 1 (f (value x.toBits)) w)",
    "a Taylor remainder of Real.sin, Real.exp, Real.arcsin, or Real.log",
    "an equation between definitions built from Wasm.IEEE64 operations"
  ],
